      "label": "Funded by a single source",
      "detail": "VOTE NURSES VALUES POLITICAL ACTION COMMITTEE: CALIFORNIA NURSES ASSOCIATION supplied $5,020,000 of NATIONAL NURSES UNITED FOR PATIENT PROTECTION's $5,520,000 itemized receipts (91%).",
